{"data": [{"author_id": "1627981083022073857", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:02:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116651972858356195"], "id": "2116651972858356195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "every time i almost switch to chatgpt dots because my feed loves it, one task is all it takes to snap me back. nearly a month in and it still feels unfinished", "url": "https://x.com/KrrishKapoor8/status/2116651972858356195"}, {"author_id": "1729999494270357504", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:49:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116648856607916520"], "id": "2116648856607916520", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1729999494270357504", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116647851115925684", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ajambrosino I rage shake submitted the bug but let me know if there’s anything else I can provide to help debug. I really wanna like this platform I love my dot when it works", "url": "https://x.com/benglickenhaus/status/2116648856607916520"}, {"author_id": "227285080", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:48:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116648431758561464"], "id": "2116648431758561464", "in_reply_to_user_id": "79177921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116431447061835967", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Gonkasevilla ChatGPT Dots through text (iMessage) will give you the Instinct experience", "url": "https://x.com/aduermael/status/2116648431758561464"}, {"author_id": "413457320", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:37:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116645739627721063"], "id": "2116645739627721063", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116645078940663922", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Oh my DOT TALK https://t.co/ps6L33Isb1", "url": "https://x.com/marzmoe/status/2116645739627721063"}, {"author_id": "1764623217602224128", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:30:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116644066905755655"], "id": "2116644066905755655", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1764623217602224128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116316529923141756", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2116644063709377000", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@daydreamsagents - solana:GMzuntWYJLpNuCizrSR7ZXggiMdDzTNiEmSNHHunpump  - $2.7M\n🟢 Agents running on @OpenAI Dots can work the Daydreams Taskmarket now, and the Taskmarket can be added to Instinct, with an agent asked to earn finding it, installing the wallet and attempting tasks https://t.co/eacDKqQdzV", "url": "https://x.com/winiam4444/status/2116644066905755655"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2116643290007154688"]}, "author_id": "2095625146065125379", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:28:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116643397603574270"], "id": "2116643397603574270", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1613004034096381952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116638208796864927", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ChrisGPT considering periodically injecting \"approved\" into my dot conversation https://t.co/g3U7GhsVjV", "url": "https://x.com/_tom_cole/status/2116643397603574270"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116640589181849601", "3_2116640589156581376", "3_2116643233686249472"]}, "author_id": "909406741384847362", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:27:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116643348245344330"], "id": "2116643348245344330", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 314, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "quick project: codex -&gt; copilot app + cli in windows harness migration.\n\nall 75+ skills, rule md files, scripts, &amp; programming languages tooling for python, rust, go, node/js i have from my mac machine porting over to my surface ultra.\n\ntransport system: my dot via zip folder😂 https://t.co/ytd5ZinSB0", "url": "https://x.com/nnennahacks/status/2116643348245344330"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116639683312521216"]}, "author_id": "14763205", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:13:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116639687062458465"], "id": "2116639687062458465", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "If this works, my Dot paid for itself this month. https://t.co/qwog8MeC0T", "url": "https://x.com/mwickens/status/2116639687062458465"}, {"author_id": "1203346345983172609", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:10:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116639053395181976"], "id": "2116639053395181976", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6545212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116623075647406200", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@zsbenke yea, that's why I mentioned \"Dots\" and \"without any workarounds\"\n\nI want it to have access to my task manager even when I'm on the go, texting my Dots in iMessage or whatever other nonsense I use (I guess @todoist must also have a ready integration with @bot although I didn't", "url": "https://x.com/Enapiuz/status/2116639053395181976"}, {"author_id": "1708061001642299392", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:48:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116633552838345171"], "id": "2116633552838345171", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It’s been 4 weeks since @OpenAI Dots were announced! How many people are still using them in their day-to-day?", "url": "https://x.com/vigram_void/status/2116633552838345171"}, {"author_id": "14756232", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:43:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116632265333895394"], "id": "2116632265333895394", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1714438092655149056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115497827845476525", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ChatGPT My feedback is that I want to be able to call my dot from my native phone, not thr app. As a mom with a baby, I love the call feature because I can do everything hands free. I want to use the call feature in native so I can use Siri to call dot without having to unlock my phone.", "url": "https://x.com/julenka/status/2116632265333895394"}, {"author_id": "1596779145073086465", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:37:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116630738632343780"], "id": "2116630738632343780", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I think most people are really sleeping on how impactful these Always on Agents (Muse/GrokBot/Dots/Duet) are going to be.\n\nChatGPT has the most info on me, so I’ve been using it the most, and it is wild getting out of a consult, having my Dot text me giving me some notes, writing", "url": "https://x.com/HyrumDolan/status/2116630738632343780"}, {"author_id": "1666104048963952642", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:35:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116630049348894999"], "id": "2116630049348894999", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "wait i can get jiaoqius lc for my dot team hes useful for something", "url": "https://x.com/coopereggsalad/status/2116630049348894999"}, {"author_id": "984446034", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:28:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116628483489108310"], "id": "2116628483489108310", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4398626122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@OpenAI Dots is the most tiring experience if you try to manage your coding sessions, complete useless it get a generic fail then for the rest of the day it can't send anything to github and stop all the work.", "url": "https://x.com/lenr4dx/status/2116628483489108310"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116627590295519232"]}, "author_id": "1659839777141841922", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:25:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116627681139966036"], "id": "2116627681139966036", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 174, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116617725204414560", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "My Dot 😵‍💫 https://t.co/ZAyFA9kCPY https://t.co/Io80emfB0T", "url": "https://x.com/realTaki42/status/2116627681139966036"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116625775411478529"]}, "author_id": "1745422970246340608", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:21:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116626626481897584"], "id": "2116626626481897584", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm tired of seeing this ugly downscaled icon of my dot, get your shit together @OpenAI ffs https://t.co/Fkjs8pMTru", "url": "https://x.com/DemetriusZhomir/status/2116626626481897584"}, {"author_id": "250383563", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:18:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116625865308037304"], "id": "2116625865308037304", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1633874951508721686", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@OpenAIDevs DevDay in Berlin was great, especially getting to talk to the people building the tools and exchange ideas.\n\nI started playing with DALL·E back in 2022. The pace of progress since then has been incredible.\n\nI build healthcare software with my teams by day and apps for", "url": "https://x.com/torstenhkunz/status/2116625865308037304"}, {"author_id": "3355378018", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:06:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116622785329967224"], "id": "2116622785329967224", "in_reply_to_user_id": "97479882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116614763287605299", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ShawnCT_ This is the harsh reality of crypto trading today. Macro events dictate everything, making my $dot bags incredibly stressful to hold.", "url": "https://x.com/garciafrederic4/status/2116622785329967224"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2116622024722243585"]}, "author_id": "2112269003335065600", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:03:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116622049158300081"], "id": "2116622049158300081", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What if your AI agent could text you? 💬\n\nOpenAI's ChatGPT dots can now text you on iMessage or RCS, with updates sent to you first. Beta for US Pro users.\n\nFull explainer: https://t.co/JveQAY1SjX\n\n#AI #AITools #CCPAcademy https://t.co/iIdX1HkVRr", "url": "https://x.com/ccpacademycom/status/2116622049158300081"}, {"author_id": "1202459457512443904", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:57:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116620703193559363"], "id": "2116620703193559363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI has a gold mine of our data and have a weird way of having us access it. Regular ChatGPT conversations have such amazing personal context. Why can’t my dot have that? I’m assuming either it is way too expensive for them to handle that level of processing or maybe they just", "url": "https://x.com/BennyMGoldberg/status/2116620703193559363"}, {"author_id": "2590289096", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:56:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116620369440157865"], "id": "2116620369440157865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ChatGPT dots can’t natively talk to someone else’s bot.\nPeerline is a deny-all bridge for that: invite → grant → short messages. No memory dump.\nJust added an MCP adapter so a ChatGPT dot can hit the same peers as a Grok Bot — OAuth-bound, account-isolated. Live connect still", "url": "https://x.com/sysrex/status/2116620369440157865"}, {"author_id": "2860984362", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:53:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116619649475326049"], "id": "2116619649475326049", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The lady who embroidered my scrubs used the wrong font and forgot my dot 😅", "url": "https://x.com/dejtheed0ll/status/2116619649475326049"}, {"author_id": "1553895169", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:42:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116616710421717226"], "id": "2116616710421717226", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1664269804558229509", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116614122188218879", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AdamHoltererer I only ask my dot things. Everything else in codex 🤙", "url": "https://x.com/NimblyPumpkin/status/2116616710421717226"}, {"author_id": "1845204847433224196", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:15:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116610115277103142"], "id": "2116610115277103142", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 176, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I gave ChatGPT Dots access to my email, calendar, and tasks, and it started helping without being asked https://t.co/hS0x7FdLe5", "url": "https://x.com/AndroOxinu/status/2116610115277103142"}, {"author_id": "1900203035839913988", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:12:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116609388014371064"], "id": "2116609388014371064", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1565897247115644930", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 292, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116606823751172461", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Angaisb_ I’ve completely stopped using ChatGPT and use my Dot instead", "url": "https://x.com/techinevolution/status/2116609388014371064"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "16_2116643290007154688", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HV_T25kXMAAZRmU.jpg", "type": "animated_gif"}, {"media_key": "3_2116640589181849601", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_RZsNbkAE50X3.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2116640589156581376", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_RZsHaAAAOtm9.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2116643233686249472", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_TznwaYAAG05r.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2116639683312521216", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_Qk9lWkAAx3LV.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2116627590295519232", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_FlDlbAAAZDrW.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2116625775411478529